{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01661","headline":"杂曲歌辞 前有一尊酒行二首 二 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 前有一尊酒行二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"琴奏龙门之绿桐，玉壶美酒清若空。\n催弦拂柱与君饮，看朱成碧颜始红。\n胡姬貌如花，当鑪笑春风。\n笑春风，舞罗衣，君今不醉欲安归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01661.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01661","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}